\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Come, divine Interpreter,
\par Bring us eyes Thy Book to read,
\par Ears the mystic words to hear,
\par Words which did from Thee proceed,
\par Words that endless bliss impart,
\par Kept in an obedient heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. All who read, or hear, are blessed,
\par If Thy plain commands we do;
\par Of Thy kingdom here possessed,
\par Thee we shall in glory view;
\par When Thou com'st on earth to abide,
\par Reign triumphant at Thy side.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

